{"seq": 1, "ts": "2026-10-24T05:45:06+0000", "actor": "human:owner", "on_behalf_of": null, "kind": "system", "summary": "初始化：空间与参与者", "ops": [{"op": "actor.register", "actor": "human:owner", "kind": "human", "label": "项目负责人"}, {"op": "actor.register", "actor": "agent:main", "kind": "agent", "creator": "human:owner", "label": "主会话"}, {"op": "space.create", "space": "p", "kind": "project", "title": "NarraFork", "owner": "human:owner"}, {"op": "space.create", "space": "me", "kind": "personal", "title": "负责人的个人空间", "owner": "human:owner"}]}
{"seq": 2, "ts": "2026-10-24T05:45:06+0000", "actor": "agent:main", "on_behalf_of": "human:owner", "kind": "edit", "summary": "录入设计决策 D1–D15", "ops": [{"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/Pa320SYM", "space": "p", "parent": null, "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "设计决策", "props": {"alias": "决策"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/7QQgsP3M", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "这一页记录大纲系统的设计决策。已确认的决策带着负责人在对话里的原话作为证据；建议还是「假设」，等负责人确认。详细论证见 docs/OUTLINE_KNOWLEDGE-DESIGN.md §16。", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/aQdrRFwd", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 2.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D1 默认直写：每次写入都带来源、可以撤销；探索 fork 的写入进层", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D1", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/cSRo6HMn", "space": "p", "parent": "p/aQdrRFwd", "order": 1.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "例外（删除或移动团队之外的人写的块、单次改动超过 50 个已有块）自动转成提议，不打断 agent", "props": {"alias": "D1a", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/PeiyVKZE", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 3.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D2 知识过期默认在读取时复核；批量复核由用户点按钮触发；后台复核默认关闭", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D2", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/OjBAfwCV", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 4.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D3 共享空间历史永久保留，会话空间历史随会话；管理员可以彻底清除；被引用的版本不能删", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D3", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/iMIREuDd", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 5.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D4 时间机器按当前权限显示历史", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D4", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/74dzXAGs", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 6.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D5 数据库是唯一真相源；永远不以 markdown 文件为真相源，永远不与 Obsidian vault 双向同步", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D5", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/oyRkMECT", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 7.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D6 支持多人实时协同编辑同一个块", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D6", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/NEN9Br1I", "space": "p", "parent": "p/oyRkMECT", "order": 1.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "选型：按页建实时会话，一页一个 Y.Doc，块正文是其中的 Y.Text；结构由服务端排序；agent 按读取版本三方合并", "props": {"alias": "D6a", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/UX1YUbm4", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 8.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D7 embedding 与 rerank 从模型目录配置，支持 API 与 OpenAI 兼容的本地端点；没配置时退化为 FTS", "props": {"alias": "D7", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/1byjKamb", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 9.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D8 知识库空间默认走审核（层即提议），可以按空间改成直写", "props": {"alias": "D8", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/YjEt8WXX", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 10.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D9 会话的读权限取所有驱动者权限的交集", "props": {"alias": "D9", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/BG0a5PpL", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 11.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D10 向量初版存成 BLOB，在 db-worker 里暴力扫描，不引入原生扩展", "props": {"alias": "D10", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/4Z0d9qlG", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 12.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D11 自研大纲编辑器，建在 ProseMirror 视图层上；块模型是真相，编辑器文档只是投影", "props": {"alias": "D11", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/D0h4UHSk", "space": "p", "parent": "p/4Z0d9qlG", "order": 1.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "不用「每块一个编辑器」作为主架构", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/I6StRgTN", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 13.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D12 多 agent：图谱是黑板；委派即建任务；角色由任务推导；开始做即领取；验收默认关闭", "props": {"alias": "D12", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/aYM78wgu", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 14.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D13 计划分草稿和已批准两档，由写计划的人声明；已批准的计划要改先停下汇报；agent 可以在权限内批准，后果落到责任人头上", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D13", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/YRVOALjs", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 15.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D14 计划模式重做：计划就是任务子树，审批时选择草稿或已批准，计划文件退役", "props": {"alias": "D14", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/gUgKSWlV", "space": "p", "parent": "p/YRVOALjs", "order": 1.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "计划不再是一段 markdown", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/4HXBJkws", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 16.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D15 计划结项：系统分拣、agent 提炼进主题页；计划归档并钉在完成那一刻；用「出处」双向追溯", "props": {"alias": "D15", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-1", "from": "p/aQdrRFwd", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「直写是需要的」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-2", "from": "p/PeiyVKZE", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「按你的推荐来」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-3", "from": "p/OjBAfwCV", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「按你的推荐来」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-4", "from": "p/iMIREuDd", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「4可以接受」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-5", "from": "p/74dzXAGs", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「永远不考虑的，我们的真相源就是数据库」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-6", "from": "p/oyRkMECT", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「多人实时协同编辑同一个块是需要考虑上的」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-7", "from": "p/D0h4UHSk", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「每块一个编辑器真的可以吗，我们可能需要重新写或者定制支持大纲文档的编辑器」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-8", "from": "p/aYM78wgu", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「依据人在写计划的时候规定这个计划是简单的粗糙的草稿还是已经经过讨论和审批的严密计划」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-9", "from": "p/aYM78wgu", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「可以支持agent批准权限内的变更。但这个后果要能最终落到创建人头上」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L2-10", "from": "p/gUgKSWlV", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「总之应该不是现在这种一段md一个plan」", "data": {}}]}
{"seq": 3, "ts": "2026-10-24T05:45:29+0000", "actor": "agent:main", "on_behalf_of": "human:owner", "kind": "edit", "summary": "录入现状盘点（锚在代码上）", "ops": [{"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/BUvPjg55", "space": "p", "parent": null, "order": 2.0, "kind": "note", "content": "现状：spec://", "props": {"alias": "现状spec"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/sqzCCSvC", "space": "p", "parent": "p/BUvPjg55", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "2026-10-23 对 main @ 7c5170d7 的盘点。每条结论都锚在代码上，main 变了就会存疑。", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/5SbJBOHq", "space": "p", "parent": "p/BUvPjg55", "order": 2.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "每个叙述者一个 spec 命名空间（narrator_id 唯一）", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/nxoITrqe", "space": "p", "parent": "p/BUvPjg55", "order": 3.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "fork 时子会话的文件指针直接引用父会话的修订行，修订行随父会话的命名空间级联删除；父会话被硬删后，子会话的文件会悄悄消失", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["坑"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/BYer0yuP", "space": "p", "parent": "p/BUvPjg55", "order": 4.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "回退会话时 spec 内容不跟着回退：只把 spec 修订的来源消息置空", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/GGLDhXV9", "space": "p", "parent": "p/BUvPjg55", "order": 5.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "tasks.json 最多 100 条，任务以正文的 hash 为身份，改一个字就成了删旧建新", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/iZyoacoR", "space": "p", "parent": "p/BUvPjg55", "order": 6.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "任务摘要默认每 15 次工具调用注入一次", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/CEIo4QC5", "space": "p", "parent": "p/BUvPjg55", "order": 7.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "spec 上的 Grep 是把全部文件读出来跑正则，没有索引", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/pMf5hzCG", "space": "p", "parent": null, "order": 3.0, "kind": "note", "content": "现状：知识库", "props": {"alias": "现状知识库"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/aOYgbhLy", "space": "p", "parent": "p/pMf5hzCG", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "2026-10-23 对 main @ 7c5170d7 的盘点。", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/sv1MJ4Xo", "space": "p", "parent": "p/pMf5hzCG", "order": 2.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "搜索先截取前 N 条，再做标签和 ACL 过滤，结果可能变少", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["坑"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/KojJGsXl", "space": "p", "parent": "p/pMf5hzCG", "order": 3.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "知识注入按当轮发起人（_currentUserId）解析权限；但上下文跨轮共享，多人会话里 A 读进来的内容 B 能问出来", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["坑"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/3NGdju5z", "space": "p", "parent": "p/pMf5hzCG", "order": 4.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "仓库里没有向量检索代码（sqlite-vec、pgvector）", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/ga38jnrJ", "space": "p", "parent": "p/pMf5hzCG", "order": 5.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "human attention 现有五种：异步提问、阻塞提问、权限、计划审批、反思", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/Xtj0I8nI", "space": "p", "parent": "p/pMf5hzCG", "order": 6.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "计划模式提交的是一段 markdown，或 .narrafork/plans/ 下的计划文件", "props": {"stance": "accepted"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-1", "from": "p/5SbJBOHq", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/db/schema.ts#specNamespaces", "data": {"fp": "8d80251268c060c6", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "20 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-2", "from": "p/5SbJBOHq", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:spec-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-3", "from": "p/nxoITrqe", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/services/knowledge/sqlite-write-store.ts#forkSpecNamespace", "data": {"fp": "724e56ed18ba0eab", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "64 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-4", "from": "p/nxoITrqe", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/db/schema.ts#specFileRevisions", "data": {"fp": "4b546322708d9a62", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "33 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-5", "from": "p/nxoITrqe", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:spec-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-6", "from": "p/BYer0yuP", "role": "based_on", "target": "grep:spec_file_revisions@server/services/revert-history-commit.ts", "data": {"fp": "8dfe5d029bfc9d93", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "1 个文件匹配"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-7", "from": "p/BYer0yuP", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:spec-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-8", "from": "p/GGLDhXV9", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/services/spec-task-service.ts#TASKS_MAX_ITEMS", "data": {"fp": "44d5c25844adbb7b", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "1 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-9", "from": "p/GGLDhXV9", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/services/spec-task-service.ts#taskTextHash", "data": {"fp": "2db6d057e6361369", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "3 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-10", "from": "p/GGLDhXV9", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:spec-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-11", "from": "p/iZyoacoR", "role": "based_on", "target": "grep:tasksReminderInterval:[[:space:]]*15@server/lib/settings/defaults.ts", "data": {"fp": "861e96b0e97d00c5", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "1 个文件匹配"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-12", "from": "p/iZyoacoR", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:spec-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-13", "from": "p/CEIo4QC5", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/lib/vfs-grep.ts", "data": {"fp": "551bf5b70ff426b0", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "177 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-14", "from": "p/CEIo4QC5", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:spec-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-15", "from": "p/sv1MJ4Xo", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/services/knowledge-service.ts#search", "data": {"fp": "1af975ec36a68b17", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "54 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-16", "from": "p/sv1MJ4Xo", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:kb-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-17", "from": "p/KojJGsXl", "role": "based_on", "target": "grep:resolveInjections[(]actingUserId@server/services/agent-runtime/orchestrator.ts", "data": {"fp": "5d737f296639c8f6", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "1 个文件匹配"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-18", "from": "p/KojJGsXl", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:kb-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-19", "from": "p/3NGdju5z", "role": "based_on", "target": "grep:sqlite-vec|pgvector@server", "data": {"fp": "da39a3ee5e6b4b0d", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "0 个文件匹配"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-20", "from": "p/3NGdju5z", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:kb-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-21", "from": "p/ga38jnrJ", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:shared/human-attention.ts#HumanAttentionKind", "data": {"fp": "f98462bc801453a2", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "6 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-22", "from": "p/ga38jnrJ", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:kb-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-23", "from": "p/Xtj0I8nI", "role": "based_on", "target": "code:server/lib/plan-file-path.ts#PLAN_DIR_REL", "data": {"fp": "ab5b7071119ceb4a", "ref": "7c5170d7", "what": "1 行"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L3-24", "from": "p/Xtj0I8nI", "role": "evidence", "target": "report:kb-inventory-2026-10-23", "data": {}}]}
{"seq": 4, "ts": "2026-10-24T05:45:47+0000", "actor": "agent:main", "on_behalf_of": "human:owner", "kind": "edit", "summary": "录入待定问题", "ops": [{"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "space": "p", "parent": null, "order": 4.0, "kind": "note", "content": "待定问题", "props": {"alias": "问题"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/i5q1KUdz", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "要负责人决定的问题指派给 human:owner，会出现在收件箱里；需要先调研的问题指派给 agent。回答写成子块，形成决策后链接到「设计决策」。", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/G8CCrUUY", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 2.0, "kind": "task", "content": "「创建人」指 agent 的创建者，还是计划的创建者？", "props": {"alias": "Q1", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/8NPAfqiW", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 3.0, "kind": "task", "content": "D1 的例外改成「转成提议、不打断 agent」，可以吗？", "props": {"alias": "Q2", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/u6vfIWaq", "space": "p", "parent": "p/8NPAfqiW", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "涉及 [[p/D1a]]", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/t5G1F2nN", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 4.0, "kind": "task", "content": "代批授权：只能逐个计划授权，还是允许责任人设一个会话级默认值？", "props": {"alias": "Q3", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/iGqfdydQ", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 5.0, "kind": "task", "content": "规划阶段默认只读（像现在的计划模式），还是默认宽松？", "props": {"alias": "Q4", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/7XCKKkng", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 6.0, "kind": "task", "content": "主题页要不要标准结构（概述、职责、关键决策、坑、不变量、试过的方案），做成内置模板？", "props": {"alias": "Q5", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/sxbH6X7b", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 7.0, "kind": "task", "content": "块内 markdown 方言支持哪些行内语法和块体？规范写法怎么定？", "props": {"alias": "Q6", "tags": ["提问", "P0"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/84a3O52n", "space": "p", "parent": "p/sxbH6X7b", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "原型发现：表格要能做块体，见「原型发现」页", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/shELx7W7", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 8.0, "kind": "task", "content": "块选择模式与移动端手势的交互细节", "props": {"alias": "Q7", "tags": ["提问", "P0"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/uBFCt3q3", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 9.0, "kind": "task", "content": "超长页：占位节点按需替换够不够，还是只靠折叠与聚焦？以 P0 性能数据为准", "props": {"alias": "Q8", "tags": ["提问", "P0"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/OL2RTQbp", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 10.0, "kind": "task", "content": "知识库旧修订：迁移时只迁当前状态，旧修订只读保留多久？", "props": {"alias": "Q9", "tags": ["提问", "P4"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/3bxAuIFU", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 11.0, "kind": "task", "content": "标签：属性里的字符串数组，还是像 Obsidian 一样每个标签对应一页？", "props": {"alias": "Q10", "tags": ["提问"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/UMJvCvWQ", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 12.0, "kind": "task", "content": "一个需求跨多个仓库时，项目空间怎么对应多个 projects 行？", "props": {"alias": "Q11", "tags": ["提问"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/XzYozzQg", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 13.0, "kind": "task", "content": "探索组的对比视图要不要内置「方案 / 结果 / 代价」模板？", "props": {"alias": "Q12", "tags": ["提问", "P4"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/WxOgq9RU", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 14.0, "kind": "task", "content": "任务反思是否保留为可选的完成证据核查？", "props": {"alias": "Q13", "tags": ["提问", "P2"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/ciIOhsMN", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 15.0, "kind": "task", "content": "团队任务树什么时候放项目空间、什么时候放会话空间，要不要让用户选？", "props": {"alias": "Q14", "tags": ["提问", "P2"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/zNm6LqxY", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 16.0, "kind": "task", "content": "可领取池除了「自动领取默认关闭」，要不要按团队配置更多策略？", "props": {"alias": "Q15", "tags": ["提问", "P2"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/5gWCGnt3", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 17.0, "kind": "task", "content": "agent 的在场信息在界面上怎么显示才不吵？", "props": {"alias": "Q16", "tags": ["提问", "P1b"], "status": "todo", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/UEVQdYkB", "space": "p", "parent": "p/5N6EK3Bl", "order": 18.0, "kind": "note", "content": "已回答", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/vIkPD0xT", "space": "p", "parent": "p/UEVQdYkB", "order": 1.0, "kind": "task", "content": "真相源放哪里？", "props": {"status": "done", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/mzqeJ3Tu", "space": "p", "parent": "p/vIkPD0xT", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "回答：数据库，永远不考虑 markdown 真相源和 vault 双向同步。见 [[p/D5]]", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/Z50dD22z", "space": "p", "parent": "p/UEVQdYkB", "order": 2.0, "kind": "task", "content": "要不要多人实时协同编辑同一个块？", "props": {"status": "done", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/PKLCmlgu", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Z50dD22z", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "回答：要。见 [[p/D6]]", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/8jNsS3fV", "space": "p", "parent": "p/UEVQdYkB", "order": 3.0, "kind": "task", "content": "每块一个编辑器可以吗？", "props": {"status": "done", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/mxVuBvKB", "space": "p", "parent": "p/8jNsS3fV", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "回答：不作为主架构，改为自研大纲编辑器。见 [[p/D11]]", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/Q9jT9DZk", "space": "p", "parent": "p/UEVQdYkB", "order": 4.0, "kind": "task", "content": "agent 能不能批准计划和变更？", "props": {"status": "done", "tags": ["提问"], "owner": "human:owner", "manager": "agent:main"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/Gov4uqE2", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Q9jT9DZk", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "回答：能，限于权限内，后果落到责任人头上。见 [[p/D13]]", "props": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-1", "from": "p/u6vfIWaq", "role": "mention", "target": "p/cSRo6HMn"}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-2", "from": "p/vIkPD0xT", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「我们的真相源就是数据库」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-3", "from": "p/mzqeJ3Tu", "role": "mention", "target": "p/74dzXAGs"}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-4", "from": "p/Z50dD22z", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「是需要考虑上的」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-5", "from": "p/PKLCmlgu", "role": "mention", "target": "p/oyRkMECT"}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-6", "from": "p/8jNsS3fV", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「我们可能需要重新写或者定制支持大纲文档的编辑器」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-7", "from": "p/mxVuBvKB", "role": "mention", "target": "p/4Z0d9qlG"}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-8", "from": "p/Q9jT9DZk", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「可以支持agent批准权限内的变更」", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L4-9", "from": "p/Gov4uqE2", "role": "mention", "target": "p/aYM78wgu"}]}
{"seq": 5, "ts": "2026-10-24T05:46:03+0000", "actor": "agent:main", "on_behalf_of": "human:owner", "kind": "edit", "summary": "录入路线图（草稿计划）", "ops": [{"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/H0a1nXuL", "space": "p", "parent": null, "order": 5.0, "kind": "task", "content": "大纲系统路线图：建成知识、记忆与任务的统一平台", "props": {"status": "doing", "alias": "路线图", "manager": "human:owner"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/byjyTdXR", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "目标：用块、类型、链接、空间、提交、层六个概念，替代 spec:// 和现有知识库，成为知识、记忆与任务的统一平台。设计见 docs/OUTLINE_KNOWLEDGE-DESIGN.md", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/egTgAts3", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 2.0, "kind": "note", "content": "验收：spec:// 与知识库退役；多人实时协同可用；多个 agent 能在大纲上协作；检索支持 embedding 与 rerank", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/6OpkjEq8", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 3.0, "kind": "note", "content": "约束：数据库是唯一真相源 [[p/D5]]；自由度由计划档位决定 [[p/D13]]", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/DrYdFrth", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 4.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P-1 Python 原型与自用：先用原型承载这份计划，真实推进，从使用中发现问题", "props": {"status": "doing", "alias": "P-1", "owner": "agent:main", "manager": "human:owner"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/uHnUVJL1", "space": "p", "parent": "p/DrYdFrth", "order": 1.0, "kind": "task", "content": "搭原型：块、链接、提交、时间机器、任务、两档计划、变更请求、断言与锚点", "props": {"status": "doing", "owner": "agent:main", "manager": "human:owner"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/NVqKvrzA", "space": "p", "parent": "p/DrYdFrth", "order": 2.0, "kind": "task", "content": "把这次的计划录进原型", "props": {"status": "doing", "owner": "agent:main", "manager": "human:owner"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/sdn8PPim", "space": "p", "parent": "p/DrYdFrth", "order": 3.0, "kind": "task", "content": "用原型推进剩下的决策，用的过程中把问题记到「原型发现」", "props": {"owner": "agent:main", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/RsN47wP2", "space": "p", "parent": "p/DrYdFrth", "order": 4.0, "kind": "task", "content": "时间机器的 HTML 查看器：静态页，拖时间轴看大纲怎么变", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/SYEAKBsz", "space": "p", "parent": "p/DrYdFrth", "order": 5.0, "kind": "task", "content": "多 agent 试用：子代理领任务、写结果、提交验收，管理者代批", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/dtLLZ8zT", "space": "p", "parent": "p/DrYdFrth", "order": 6.0, "kind": "task", "content": "新鲜度检查对着最新的 main 跑一次（先 fetch）", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/eYUSIhDP", "space": "p", "parent": "p/DrYdFrth", "order": 7.0, "kind": "task", "content": "把原型发现整理回设计文档", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/ydKe7oMn", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 5.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P0 设计与验证", "props": {"alias": "P0", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/UV8qXrr2", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ydKe7oMn", "order": 1.0, "kind": "task", "content": "设计文档讨论稿", "props": {"status": "done", "manager": "human:owner"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/gPDU0vgb", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ydKe7oMn", "order": 2.0, "kind": "task", "content": "大纲编辑器与实时协同原型，按设计文档 §7.8 的清单验收", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/BFv4Byng", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ydKe7oMn", "order": 3.0, "kind": "task", "content": "按时间点读取的性能基准（SQLite 与 PG）", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/wBqGEPp7", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ydKe7oMn", "order": 4.0, "kind": "task", "content": "db-worker 向量扫描基准", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/5QM1KHbG", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ydKe7oMn", "order": 5.0, "kind": "task", "content": "agent 使用结构化编辑工具的实测：Python 原型已经覆盖了一部分", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/aTj0jdv3", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ydKe7oMn", "order": 6.0, "kind": "task", "content": "确认 D6–D15 的建议", "props": {"manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/bd2Egjgc", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 6.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P1a 核心存储、大纲编辑器（先单人，建在协同协议上）、时间机器最小版、会话读权限", "props": {"alias": "P1a", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/kDh2CgDg", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 7.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P1b 多人实时协同：页订阅、页实时会话、在场信息、大纲事务、agent 的三方合并", "props": {"alias": "P1b", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/f7vElM5K", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 8.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P2 替换 spec://，落地多 agent 协作、两档计划与计划模式改造", "props": {"alias": "P2", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/yxk3tBVg", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 9.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P3 检索（embedding、rerank、混合检索）、真值维护、计划结项", "props": {"alias": "P3", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/pJciER7x", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 10.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P4 层（提议、探索、记忆确认、Bot 隔离）与知识库迁移", "props": {"alias": "P4", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/2Ywkt58i", "space": "p", "parent": "p/H0a1nXuL", "order": 11.0, "kind": "task", "content": "P5 视图编辑器、图谱与图谱时间机器、模板、实体合并、只读导出", "props": {"alias": "P5", "manager": "human:owner", "status": "todo"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-1", "from": "p/6OpkjEq8", "role": "mention", "target": "p/74dzXAGs"}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-2", "from": "p/6OpkjEq8", "role": "mention", "target": "p/aYM78wgu"}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-3", "from": "p/sdn8PPim", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/NVqKvrzA", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-4", "from": "p/eYUSIhDP", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/NVqKvrzA", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-5", "from": "p/UV8qXrr2", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:9dc0c1ee", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-6", "from": "p/UV8qXrr2", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:eeb244b6", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-7", "from": "p/gPDU0vgb", "role": "touches", "target": "file:docs/OUTLINE_KNOWLEDGE-DESIGN.md", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-8", "from": "p/5QM1KHbG", "role": "source", "target": "p/DrYdFrth", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-9", "from": "p/aTj0jdv3", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/DrYdFrth", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-10", "from": "p/bd2Egjgc", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/ydKe7oMn", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-11", "from": "p/kDh2CgDg", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/bd2Egjgc", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-12", "from": "p/f7vElM5K", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/bd2Egjgc", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-13", "from": "p/yxk3tBVg", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/f7vElM5K", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-14", "from": "p/pJciER7x", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/yxk3tBVg", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L5-15", "from": "p/2Ywkt58i", "role": "blocked_by", "target": "p/pJciER7x", "data": {}}]}
{"seq": 6, "ts": "2026-10-24T05:46:28+0000", "actor": "agent:main", "on_behalf_of": "human:owner", "kind": "edit", "summary": "记录原型发现", "ops": [{"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/TMdwYNRd", "space": "p", "parent": null, "order": 6.0, "kind": "note", "content": "原型发现", "props": {"alias": "发现"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/CBTVZMXi", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "搭原型和录入计划时发现的设计问题。每条都是要反馈进设计文档的修改，整理回文档后标为已处理。", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/8ufzzqLQ", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 2.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "块体需要「表格」：现状盘点、决策对照都离不开表格，设计文档 §2.1 的块体只有段落、标题、代码、引用", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/YwjRs6kJ", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 3.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "一次插入多块时需要临时标签（#标签）互相引用，比如步骤二前置于步骤一；正式版的 OutlineEdit 要支持", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/bBLXUFIK", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 4.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "需要人能记住的稳定别名（D1、P0、路线图）：随机短 id 只适合机器，人和 agent 在对话里都用别名", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/kJThz9Os", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 5.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "「某样东西不存在」这类结论锚不到符号上（比如仓库里没有向量代码），需要「检索锚点」：记下一个检索和它的结果集，结果变了就存疑", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/PoBH5Bog", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 6.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "锚点要能指向非声明的位置（数组里的一项、配置对象的一个键）；原型用检索锚点兜底，正式版要支持结构路径或行范围", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/AKv45oAj", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 7.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D1 的「单次改动超过 50 个块」应该只数改动已有的块；一次新建很多块不碰别人的内容，不算大改动", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/b4NURQO1", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 8.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "已批准的计划里，只有任务才算步骤：在步骤下写笔记、断言是记录进展，不算改计划。契约 = 计划根 + 根下直接挂着的非任务块", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/PH5Odq0r", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 9.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "变更请求只让被改的那一步受阻；新增步骤不影响已有步骤，不该让整份计划停下", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/AGjS85c8", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 10.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "获授权的 agent 自己改已批准的计划，也要走变更请求、由别人来批，否则「代批」就成了绕过", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/CevSO7EI", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 11.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "人确认个人空间的提议时，确认本身就是证据，被确认的断言应直接采纳", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/wfB9Zsos", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 12.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "计划根完成时还有子任务没做完：提示但不阻止，结项时它们成为遗留", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/gCpTvLbi", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 13.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "管理者应该沿任务子树继承：路线图归负责人管，它下面 agent 建的步骤也归负责人管", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/PllM72C8", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 14.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "对话里做出的决定没有稳定地址：原型只能写「chat:日期 + 原话」；正式版里应该指向 msg: 消息 id", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/6hhSPqRU", "space": "p", "parent": "p/TMdwYNRd", "order": 15.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "写检索锚点时，正则里的反斜杠会被参数解析吃掉；agent 写锚点需要不依赖转义的写法", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "tags": ["发现"]}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-1", "from": "p/8ufzzqLQ", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-2", "from": "p/YwjRs6kJ", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-3", "from": "p/bBLXUFIK", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-4", "from": "p/kJThz9Os", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-5", "from": "p/PoBH5Bog", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-6", "from": "p/AKv45oAj", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-7", "from": "p/b4NURQO1", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-8", "from": "p/PH5Odq0r", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-9", "from": "p/AGjS85c8", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-10", "from": "p/CevSO7EI", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-11", "from": "p/wfB9Zsos", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-12", "from": "p/gCpTvLbi", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-13", "from": "p/PllM72C8", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L6-14", "from": "p/6hhSPqRU", "role": "evidence", "target": "commit:aae9623b", "data": {}}]}
{"seq": 7, "ts": "2026-10-24T05:46:28+0000", "actor": "agent:main", "on_behalf_of": "human:owner", "kind": "edit", "summary": "录入概念与规则", "ops": [{"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/a4bsGcVR", "space": "p", "parent": null, "order": 7.0, "kind": "note", "content": "概念与规则", "props": {"alias": "概念"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/CQhWv1YD", "space": "p", "parent": "p/a4bsGcVR", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "六个概念：块、类型、链接、空间、提交、层。详见 docs/OUTLINE_KNOWLEDGE-DESIGN.md §2", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/ay8D5pME", "space": "p", "parent": "p/a4bsGcVR", "order": 2.0, "kind": "note", "content": "九条规则", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/zb1ow927", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 1.0, "kind": "note", "content": "一切关系都是链接，含义由角色决定", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/2uUBkSI4", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 2.0, "kind": "note", "content": "能推导的不存储：新鲜度、「已被取代」都从链接推导", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/3jlovrjM", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 3.0, "kind": "note", "content": "历史只追加：撤销是补偿提交，fork 是复制", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/V1utFors", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 4.0, "kind": "note", "content": "块不跨空间：跨空间「移动」是复制加原处删除", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/cC6VPdFb", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 5.0, "kind": "note", "content": "层只为待决定的改动而存在", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/1iTUhoFx", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 6.0, "kind": "note", "content": "注入即视图", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/5TYh69qJ", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 7.0, "kind": "note", "content": "人看实时，agent 看快照", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/orLbw5BK", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 8.0, "kind": "note", "content": "图谱是黑板：以后还会用到的东西都写进图谱", "props": {}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/8T6jFKZI", "space": "p", "parent": "p/ay8D5pME", "order": 9.0, "kind": "note", "content": "自由度由计划决定：草稿随情况改；已批准的计划，要改先停下汇报 [[p/D13]]", "props": {}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L7-1", "from": "p/8T6jFKZI", "role": "mention", "target": "p/aYM78wgu"}]}
