{"seq": 19, "ts": "2026-10-24T06:00:20+0000", "actor": "agent:main", "on_behalf_of": "human:owner", "kind": "edit", "summary": "记下负责人的新要求：专注与协调", "ops": [{"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/CZyp6nnF", "space": "p", "parent": "p/Pa320SYM", "order": 17.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "D16 系统要支持派「没有什么约束」的专注 agent 集中攻坚，由遵循规则的协调 agent 帮它们记账、处理规则", "props": {"stance": "accepted", "alias": "D16", "tags": ["决策"]}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/QSWtw144", "space": "p", "parent": "p/CZyp6nnF", "order": 1.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "专注 agent 只拿到普通语言写的任务说明，不知道大纲、地址、角色和规则；它交一份报告就结束", "props": {"alias": "D16a", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/oYaXx3vw", "space": "p", "parent": "p/CZyp6nnF", "order": 2.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "协调 agent 把报告翻译成大纲上的东西：状态、证据、结论、遗留、提议；以专注 agent 的身份代记，并留下自己的名字", "props": {"alias": "D16b", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "block.create", "addr": "p/ZZkZIZOE", "space": "p", "parent": "p/CZyp6nnF", "order": 3.0, "kind": "assertion", "content": "「无约束」指不背大纲协议，不是不受安全约束：工具权限、行为边界照旧由系统强制", "props": {"alias": "D16c", "tags": ["决策", "待确认"], "stance": "hypothesis"}}, {"op": "link.add", "id": "L19-1", "from": "p/CZyp6nnF", "role": "evidence", "target": "chat:2026-10-24「这套系统需要支持派一些没有什么约束的子agent来集中精力攻坚，由遵循规则的agent来帮忙协调处理」", "data": {}}]}
